title: Skg is feasible.
pid: 6e724a89-a6ea-47f3-821c-184a1b1b5bdd
body: |2-
  Choosing some atoms to grow, and growing them, is easy.
  Admittedly, choosing the right ones,
  and giving them appropriate attention (growing them),
  quickly becomes a deep and broad task.
  The number of potential atoms is large,
  but they don't all need recording.
  Only what deserves recording deserves recording.
